      "summary": ": Tuesday 04/08 07:15am - Aiming for a 08:30am open on Learners and McDougall's. Whitestar, Valley View and Captains will follow! The teams will then head on over to Soho and Willows. We had 4 cms of snow overnight with very strong winds. Winds are still strong but are easing and are forecast to continue to ease. There will be a delay while teams gets lifts dug out and deiced this morning. It is very cold with southwest winds so dress warm! Today will be mostly cloudy with a few snow showers and a potential afternoon clearance. There are some big drifts and some areas that have been wind scoured. Teams are out regrooming the main runs. Visibility on the road is low. Please turn headlights on and increase following distance.",
